The catalyst is the Q2 revenue record and EPS beat even after the highest quarterly fuel

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.700
expense in company history. The technical setup shows price action above the 50-day moving

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:26.120
average on the daily chart. Watch for volume confirmation above the 20-day average on a follow-through

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:32.240
day. Risk assessment notes that a sudden oil spike or consumer spending slowdown could pressure

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:40.700
margins so set a stop loss at 6% below entry. The target is plus 3% to plus 6% over the weekly window

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:47.300
