00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:06.480
entries. Before we review yesterday's result, here is the performance snapshot. Last weekly hold was

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:14.120
cost on analyst unreassuring momentum after strong same-store sales data. Entry came at $934

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:25.680
in 94 cents on Thursday open. Exit came at $912.97 on Thursday close. The result was a loss of 2.35%

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:36.600
or $23.50 on a $1,000 position. The trade lost 2.35% while the NASDAQ rose 1.3% over the same

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:45.120
